<?php $title='How it works';require 'header.php';?><main class="guide"><div class="kicker"><span></span> PROCESS</div><h1>A dispute is a case, not a conversation thread.</h1><div class="guide-steps"><article><b>01</b><h2>Submit</h2><p>Describe the issue, transaction and outcome you're seeking.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h2>Evidence</h2><p>Attach relevant documents or screenshots. A chronological record is easier to review.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h2>Review</h2><p>A reviewer evaluates the case and can request or record the next action.</p></article><article><b>04</b><h2>Resolution</h2><p>The case status and public timeline tell you when the matter is resolved or closed.</p></article></div></main><?php require 'footer.php'; ?>